# Protect intro animation

The Studio Romann homepage intro is a **locked baseline**. Do not change it when working on project pages, BRDs, layouts, footer, hover, video mute UI, or other site edits.

## Do not edit (unless user explicitly asks about the intro / opening / morph)

- `components/OpeningAnimation.tsx`
- `components/HomeExperience.tsx` (opening mount, morphTiles wiring, handoff / videosEnabled for intro)
- `app/opening.css`
- Shuffle helpers used by the intro in `lib/projects.ts`: `buildShuffledHomepageGrid`, `getItemMorphMedia`, `MorphMedia`
- Opening letter assets under `public/brand/romann-logo-*.png`

## Behavior that must stay

1. Letter **ROMANN** morphs into the **shuffled** homepage tile order (R fixed first).
2. Video project tiles play muted during the morph.
3. Next row continues the cascade after OMANN.
4. Seamless handoff into the live grid (same metrics; no layout jump).
5. Intro plays on **full load / refresh of `/` only** — not when navigating back from a project page. Replay mid-session with `?forceOpening=1`. Skip with `?skipOpening=1` or `prefers-reduced-motion`.
6. Homepage grid shuffle is **cached for the document load** — same order when returning from a project; new shuffle only on full refresh.

## When editing other features

- Prefer editing case-study components, project data fields, and non-opening sections of `app/globals.css`.
- Never remove, replace, or “simplify” the intro to fix unrelated bugs.
- Never switch back to `opening.mp4` unless the user asks for that file specifically.
